<title>USA: ABM Industries Q3 July 31 net up.  [CORRECTED 01:21 GMT 12/9]</title>
<headline>ABM Industries Q3 July 31 net up.  [CORRECTED 01:21 GMT 12/9]</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to show net has risen)</p>
<p>ABM Industries Incorporated Three Months Ended July 31:</p>
<p>						    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>				1995	     1996	   Increase</p>
<p> Revenues		$245,792,000    $281,911,000    15% Net</p>
<p> Income		  $5,010,000	$6,036,000	20% Net</p>
<p>Income per Common</p>
<p>and Common</p>
<p> Equivalent Share	$0.26	     $0.29	     12%</p>
<p>Common and Common</p>
<p> Equivalent Shares   19,254,000	20,478,000	   6%</p>
<p>Nine Months Ended</p>
<p> July 31: Revenues   $712,250,000   $798,381,000	  12%</p>
<p> Net Income	    $ 12,340,000   $ 14,784,000	  20%</p>
<p>Net Income per Common</p>
<p>and Common</p>
<p> Equivalent Share	  $0.63	    $0.72		4%</p>
<p>Common and Common</p>
<p> Equivalent Shares    18,994,000	20,129,000	   6%</p>
<p>Note: All share and per share amounts reflect a 2-for-1 stock split on July 15, 1996.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
